{"title":"Career Roadmap · Government Affairs Executive","role":"Government Affairs Executive","summary":"A Government Affairs Executive works at the intersection of business, government, regulation and public policy.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Political Economy / Public Policy / Governance"},"about":[{"label":"Degree Alignment","text":"Excellent"},{"label":"Primary Sectors","text":"Corporates, Public Affairs, Government Relations, Consulting, Infrastructure, Technology, Healthcare, Energy, Finance"},{"label":"Typical Entry Roles","text":"Government Affairs Associate, Public Affairs Associate, Policy Research Associate, Regulatory Affairs Associate"},{"label":"Long-Term Roles","text":"Government Affairs Manager → Senior Manager → Director of Government Affairs → Head of Public Affairs"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Government Affairs Executive works at the intersection of business, government, regulation and public policy."},{"type":"p","text":"The role involves helping an organisation understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government policies"},{"text":"Laws and regulations"},{"text":"Regulatory developments"},{"text":"Public-sector stakeholders"},{"text":"Policy changes"},{"text":"Industry-government relationships"},{"text":"Compliance implications"},{"text":"Public-policy risks"},{"text":"Government programmes and priorities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The professional may work for a company, industry association, consulting firm, think tank or public-affairs organisation."},{"type":"p","text":"For a BA specialising in Political Economy / Public Policy / Governance, this is a strong career alignment."},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Government Affairs is different from being a government employee. A Government Affairs Executive is usually a private-sector or institutional role that manages policy and government relationships. It should also be distinguished from legal counsel and formal lobbying/legal-representation roles, which can have additional requirements depending on jurisdiction."}]},{"heading":"What Does a Government Affairs Executive Do?","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A typical workflow is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Monitor policy","Analyse implications","Identify stakeholders","Prepare internal briefing","Coordinate organisational response","Engage relevant stakeholders","Monitor outcomes"]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical responsibilities"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Responsibilities"],"rows":[[{"text":"Policy monitoring"},{"text":"Track bills, regulations, notifications and government policies"}],[{"text":"Policy analysis"},{"text":"Understand implications for the organisation"}],[{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Track sector-specific regulatory developments"}],[{"text":"Government relations"},{"text":"Coordinate engagement with relevant public institutions"}],[{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Map and maintain stakeholder relationships"}],[{"text":"Briefings"},{"text":"Prepare policy notes and executive summaries"}],[{"text":"Industry associations"},{"text":"Participate in industry consultations and working groups"}],[{"text":"Advocacy"},{"text":"Support evidence-based policy positions"}],[{"text":"Public affairs"},{"text":"Coordinate external policy communication"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Analyse political-economic and regulatory developments"}],[{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Prepare internal government-affairs updates"}],[{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Identify policy and regulatory risks"}],[{"text":"Events"},{"text":"Support government/industry roundtables and consultations"}]]}]},{"heading":"Career Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"During BA"},{"text":"Public Policy Intern, Government Affairs Intern, Research Intern"}],[{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Government Affairs Associate, Public Affairs Associate, Policy Associate"}],[{"text":"1–4 years"},{"text":"Government Affairs Executive, Policy Analyst, Regulatory Affairs Associate"}],[{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"Senior Government Affairs Executive, Public Affairs Manager"}],[{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"Government Affairs Manager, Senior Public Affairs Manager"}],[{"text":"10+ years"},{"text":"Director – Government Affairs, Head of Public Affairs, Corporate Affairs Director"}]]}]},{"heading":"Build Skills During the BA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Governance & Political Economy Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Indian Constitution"},{"text":"Political institutions"},{"text":"Public administration"},{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Political economy"},{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Public finance"},{"text":"International relations"},{"text":"Regulatory institutions"},{"text":"Business-government relationships"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Professional skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"PowerPoint"},{"text":"Google Workspace"},{"text":"Professional writing"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Current-affairs analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"First project"},{"type":"h","text":"Government Policy Tracker"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one sector such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Technology"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Telecommunications"},{"text":"Automotive"},{"text":"E-commerce"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Major policy developments"},{"text":"Government announcements"},{"text":"Regulatory changes"},{"text":"Industry response"},{"text":"Potential business implications"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 2 — Policy Research & Analysis","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The student should learn to convert government information into business-relevant insights."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy research"},{"text":"Regulatory research"},{"text":"Legislative analysis"},{"text":"Stakeholder mapping"},{"text":"Public consultation"},{"text":"Policy evaluation"},{"text":"Economic analysis"},{"text":"Government schemes"},{"text":"Industry analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Basic SQL"},{"text":"Basic Python"},{"text":"Data visualisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Policy Impact Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"How a New Digital Regulation Could Affect E-commerce Businesses"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy objective"},{"text":"Key provisions"},{"text":"Organisations affected"},{"text":"Compliance implications"},{"text":"Economic implications"},{"text":"Stakeholders"},{"text":"Implementation challenges"},{"text":"Business response options"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"p","text":"10-page policy report + executive briefing deck."}]},{"heading":"Year 3 — Government Relations & Public Affairs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Move from research into stakeholder and engagement skills."},{"type":"h","text":"Learn"},{"type":"h","text":"Stakeholder mapping"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government departments"},{"text":"Regulators"},{"text":"Legislators"},{"text":"Industry associations"},{"text":"Businesses"},{"text":"NGOs"},{"text":"Researchers"},{"text":"Media"},{"text":"Civil-society organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Stakeholder analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Map stakeholders according to:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Influence","Interest","Position","Relevance"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Learn communication"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy briefs"},{"text":"Government briefing notes"},{"text":"Position papers"},{"text":"Consultation submissions"},{"text":"Executive summaries"},{"text":"Talking points"},{"text":"Presentation decks"},{"text":"Meeting notes"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"h","text":"Government Affairs Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Select an industry and create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy landscape"},{"text":"Stakeholder map"},{"text":"Regulatory issues"},{"text":"Industry concerns"},{"text":"Evidence base"},{"text":"Engagement strategy"},{"text":"Consultation strategy"},{"text":"Risk register"},{"text":"Communication plan"}]}]},{"heading":"Year 4 — Become Employer Ready","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The final year should focus on practical government-affairs work."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Regulatory Intelligence Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a dashboard tracking:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Regulations"},{"text":"Policy announcements"},{"text":"Sector developments"},{"text":"Government schemes"},{"text":"Regulatory deadlines"},{"text":"Industry implications"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use:"},{"type":"h","text":"Excel + Power BI"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Policy Brief"},{"type":"p","text":"Write a professional 5–8 page brief:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Policy Issue","Evidence","Economic Impact","Stakeholders","Recommendations"]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Stakeholder Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a stakeholder map for a sector such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Energy"},{"text":"Telecom"},{"text":"E-commerce"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Government Consultation Simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Create:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Consultation response"},{"text":"Industry position paper"},{"text":"Evidence summary"},{"text":"Stakeholder arguments"},{"text":"Executive briefing"}]}]},{"heading":"Four-Year Development Plan","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Key Output"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Governance + economics"},{"text":"Policy tracker"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Policy research + data"},{"text":"Policy impact report"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Public affairs + stakeholder management"},{"text":"Government-affairs strategy"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Regulatory intelligence"},{"text":"Portfolio + internship"}]]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Governance"},{"text":"Government institutions, public administration"}],[{"text":"Economics"},{"text":"Political economy, public finance"}],[{"text":"Policy"},{"text":"Policy analysis, evaluation"}],[{"text":"Regulation"},{"text":"Regulatory research and monitoring"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Evidence gathering and source evaluation"}],[{"text":"Stakeholders"},{"text":"Mapping and engagement"}],[{"text":"Writing"},{"text":"Policy briefs, position papers"}],[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Executive presentations, talking points"}],[{"text":"Data"},{"text":"Excel, Power BI, basic SQL"}],[{"text":"Risk"},{"text":"Regulatory/policy risk analysis"}],[{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"Sector-specific knowledge"}],[{"text":"Digital"},{"text":"Policy monitoring and research tools"}],[{"text":"AI"},{"text":"Policy research, document analysis"}],[{"text":"Ethics"},{"text":"Transparency, conflicts of interest, responsible engagement"}]]}]},{"heading":"Government Affairs vs Related Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These roles overlap but are not identical."},{"type":"table","header":["Career","Primary Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Government Affairs"},{"text":"Government relationships + policy"}],[{"text":"Public Affairs"},{"text":"Government + public policy + broader external affairs"}],[{"text":"Policy Analyst"},{"text":"Policy research and analysis"}],[{"text":"Regulatory Affairs"},{"text":"Sector regulations and compliance"}],[{"text":"Corporate Affairs"},{"text":"Government + media + reputation + external stakeholders"}],[{"text":"Public Policy"},{"text":"Policy design, research and advocacy"}],[{"text":"Legal Counsel"},{"text":"Legal interpretation and legal representation"}],[{"text":"Public Relations"},{"text":"Media and public communication"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"A Government Affairs Executive should understand enough of each neighbouring function to collaborate effectively."}]},{"heading":"Sector Specialisations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Government-affairs professionals become particularly valuable when they understand a specific industry."},{"type":"h","text":"Technology & AI"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI governance"},{"text":"Data protection"},{"text":"Digital platforms"},{"text":"Cybersecurity"},{"text":"Digital competition"},{"text":"Emerging technology policy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible role:"},{"type":"h","text":"Technology Government Affairs Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech & Banking"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial regulation"},{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"Banking policy"},{"text":"Consumer protection"},{"text":"Financial inclusion"},{"text":"FinTech regulation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible role:"},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech Public Policy Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Healthcare policy"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"Medical devices"},{"text":"Health insurance"},{"text":"Public health"},{"text":"Digital health"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible role:"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Government Affairs Executive"},{"type":"h","text":"Energy"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Electricity policy"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Energy markets"},{"text":"Climate policy"},{"text":"Energy transition"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible role:"},{"type":"h","text":"Energy Public Affairs Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Telecom"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Telecommunications regulation"},{"text":"Spectrum policy"},{"text":"Digital infrastructure"},{"text":"Broadband"},{"text":"Connectivity"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible role:"},{"type":"h","text":"Telecom Government Affairs Executive"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Internships are extremely important for this career."},{"type":"h","text":"Target organisations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Corporate public-affairs teams"},{"text":"Government-affairs departments"},{"text":"Public-policy consultancies"},{"text":"Think tanks"},{"text":"Industry associations"},{"text":"Research organisations"},{"text":"Consulting firms"},{"text":"Regulatory-policy teams"},{"text":"Chambers of commerce"},{"text":"Development organisations"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Internship titles"},{"type":"p","text":"Search for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Government Affairs Intern"},{"text":"Public Policy Intern"},{"text":"Public Affairs Intern"},{"text":"Policy Research Intern"},{"text":"Regulatory Affairs Intern"},{"text":"Corporate Affairs Intern"},{"text":"Government Relations Intern"},{"text":"Research Intern"},{"text":"Public Affairs Research Intern"}]}]},{"heading":"What to Learn During an Internship","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Try to gain experience in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy monitoring"},{"text":"Government notifications"},{"text":"Regulatory research"},{"text":"Stakeholder databases"},{"text":"Policy brief preparation"},{"text":"Meeting preparation"},{"text":"Industry research"},{"text":"Government schemes"},{"text":"Consultation documents"},{"text":"Executive reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A useful internship output could be:"},{"type":"h","text":"Weekly Regulatory Intelligence Report"},{"type":"p","text":"summarising:"},{"type":"flow","items":["What changed","Why it matters","Who is affected","What the organisation should monitor"]}]},{"heading":"Certifications & Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Certificates are secondary to research and practical experience."},{"type":"h","text":"Useful areas"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Public policy"},{"text":"Government affairs"},{"text":"Regulatory affairs"},{"text":"Political economy"},{"text":"Public administration"},{"text":"Business strategy"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Project management"},{"text":"Data analytics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technical"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Data visualisation"},{"text":"Research databases"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Communication"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business writing"},{"text":"Policy writing"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Public speaking"}]}]},{"heading":"Policy Research Method","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Government Affairs Executive should be able to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"What changed?"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify the policy/regulation."},{"type":"p","text":"Why did it change?"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the policy objective."},{"type":"p","text":"Who is affected?"},{"type":"p","text":"Identify:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Businesses"},{"text":"Consumers"},{"text":"Government"},{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"Communities"}]},{"type":"p","text":"What is the impact?"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cost"},{"text":"Compliance"},{"text":"Operations"},{"text":"Market structure"},{"text":"Investment"},{"text":"Risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"What should the organisation do?"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Immediate actions"},{"text":"Medium-term actions"},{"text":"Stakeholder engagement"},{"text":"Compliance considerations"},{"text":"Monitoring requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This is the core analytical value of the role."}]},{"heading":"Government Affairs Portfolio","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build a professional portfolio containing:"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Policy Tracker"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one industry and track six months of policy developments."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Regulatory Impact Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse a regulation and its potential business implications."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Stakeholder Map"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a detailed industry stakeholder map."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Policy Brief"},{"type":"p","text":"Write a concise evidence-based policy brief."},{"type":"h","text":"5. Government Affairs Strategy"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop a simulated engagement strategy around a policy issue."},{"type":"h","text":"6. Sector Report"},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"h","text":"“AI Policy Landscape and Business Implications for the Indian Technology Sector.”"},{"type":"p","text":"This demonstrates much more than a generic policy certificate."}]},{"heading":"Jobs After BA","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Direct-entry roles"},{"type":"table","header":["Job Title","Alignment"],"rows":[[{"text":"Government Affairs Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Government Affairs Executive"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Public Affairs Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Public Policy Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Policy Research Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Regulatory Affairs Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Government Relations Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Corporate Affairs Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Public Policy Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Policy Research Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Regulatory Research Analyst"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Industry Affairs Associate"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐"}],[{"text":"Public Affairs Executive"},{"text":"⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Some employers may expect a more specialised degree for regulatory roles, particularly where the work involves technical or legal compliance."}]},{"heading":"Employer-Ready Skill Stack","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A strong graduate profile would be:"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Political Economy/Public Policy/Governance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Policy research"},{"text":"Regulatory monitoring"},{"text":"Political-economic analysis"},{"text":"Stakeholder mapping"},{"text":"Policy writing"},{"text":"Excel + Power BI"},{"text":"Industry knowledge"},{"text":"2 internships"},{"text":"4–5 policy portfolio projects"},{"text":"Strong professional communication"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Options","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A PG can significantly strengthen progression into specialised government affairs and public-policy roles."},{"type":"table","header":["PG Degree","Best For"],"rows":[[{"text":"MA Public Policy"},{"text":"Policy/government affairs"}],[{"text":"MA Political Science"},{"text":"Governance/policy"}],[{"text":"MA Public Administration"},{"text":"Government/governance"}],[{"text":"MA Economics"},{"text":"Political economy"}],[{"text":"MSc Economics"},{"text":"Quantitative policy"}],[{"text":"MA International Relations"},{"text":"International affairs"}],[{"text":"MA Development Studies"},{"text":"Development policy"}],[{"text":"MBA"},{"text":"Corporate/public affairs management"}],[{"text":"MBA Public Policy"},{"text":"Corporate-government interface"}],[{"text":"MBA Strategy"},{"text":"Corporate strategy + policy"}],[{"text":"LLM/Legal Studies"},{"text":"Legal-policy specialisation, subject to eligibility"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Particularly strong combinations"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Public Policy → MA Public Policy"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Political Economy → MA Economics"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Governance → MA Public Administration"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Public Policy → MBA"},{"type":"h","text":"BA Political Economy → MA International Relations"}]},{"heading":"Corporate Government Affairs Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"One common private-sector progression is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Policy Intern","Government Affairs Associate","Government Affairs Executive","Senior Government Affairs Executive","Government Affairs Manager","Senior Manager","Director – Government Affairs","Head of Government Affairs"]}]},{"heading":"Public Policy Consulting Path","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Another route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Research Intern","Policy Research Associate","Policy Analyst","Senior Policy Analyst","Policy Consultant/Manager","Policy Practice Lead"]},{"type":"p","text":"This path is useful for students who enjoy research more than stakeholder-facing work."}]},{"heading":"AI-Era Government Affairs","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Government Affairs is becoming increasingly data-driven."},{"type":"h","text":"AI can help with"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Monitoring large volumes of policy documents"},{"text":"Comparing regulatory texts"},{"text":"Extracting policy changes"},{"text":"Summarising government notifications"},{"text":"Tracking stakeholder statements"},{"text":"Analysing consultation documents"},{"text":"Building regulatory databases"},{"text":"Identifying policy trends"},{"text":"Preparing briefing drafts"},{"text":"Analysing economic data"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Future workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Policy documents","AI-assisted extraction","Regulatory database","Impact analysis","Human validation","Executive briefing","Strategic response"]},{"type":"p","text":"Human judgement remains essential because policy interpretation involves context, legal nuance, institutional relationships and ethical considerations."}]},{"heading":"Emerging Careers","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The degree can lead to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI Policy Analyst"},{"text":"Technolo